{"sections":[{"slug":"形变","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"形变"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">形变</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“形变”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是光滑</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数簇</span>, $(Y,y_0)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是带基点</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":". $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $(Y,y_0)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">形变</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是一个平坦</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧合映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧合映射</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">与一个同构</span> $\\psi\\colon X\\to \\varphi^{-1}(y_0)$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">一阶无穷小形变</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $(\\operatorname{Spec}k[x]/(x^2),(x))$ <span lang=\"zh\">之上的形变</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">曲线的无穷小形变</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/曲线","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">曲线</span>"}},{"Plain":" $C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的无穷小形变的空间即为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/模空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的切空间</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">由此可计算模空间的维数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Serre对偶","text":"Serre <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\nH^1(C,T_C) \\simeq H^0 (C,T^\\vee_C\\otimes\\omega_C)^\\vee \\simeq H^0(C,\\omega_C^{\\otimes 2}),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">后一个等式是因为</span> $T_C^\\vee=\\omega_C$; <span lang=\"zh\">又由</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemann--Roch定理","text":"Riemann–Roch <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\n\\dim H^0 (C,\\omega_C^{\\otimes 2})- \\dim H^1(C,\\omega_C^{\\otimes 2})=\\deg(\\omega^{\\otimes 2})+g-1=3g-3,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">又因为</span> $H^1(C,\\omega_C^{\\otimes 2})=0$ (<span lang=\"zh\">为什么</span>?), <span lang=\"zh\">所以曲线模空间的维数为</span>\n$$\r\n\\dim H^1(C,T_C)=3g-3.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}